<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/ethiopian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ethiopian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ethiopian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Italian forces using aerial bombardment and poison gas capture Addis Ababa</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/italian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Italian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Italian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Mussolini proclaims the empire after Addis Ababa falls; Africa Orientale Italiana is formed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/liangzhu-culture"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Liangzhu%20culture.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Liangzhu culture</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Shi Xingeng first excavates the type site at Liangzhu in Yuhang County, Zhejiang</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/manchukuo"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Manchukuo.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Manchukuo</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Five Year Plans modelled on the Soviet Union's begin; Nobusuke Kishi, deputy minister since 1935, brings the zaibatsu into a state-directed heavy industry.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/mandatory-palestine"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mandatory%20Palestine.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mandatory Palestine</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Arab general strike of April to October, led by the Arab Higher Committee under Amin al-Husseini, opens the Arab revolt in Palestine.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/travancore"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Travancore.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Travancore</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 12 November Chithira Thirunal's Temple Entry Proclamation opens the temples of Travancore to the backward communities.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/communism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Communism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Communism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Stalin’s Great Purge begins; in the Moscow trials leading old Bolsheviks are accused, plead guilty to conspiracy and are executed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/anarchism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Anarchism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Anarchism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">In the Spanish Revolution anarchists and syndicalists of the CNT and FAI take control of Barcelona and collectivise land</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/maoism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Maoism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Maoism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Mao’s pamphlet Strategic Problems of China’s Revolutionary War marks his turn away from the Soviet model</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/fascism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Fascism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Fascism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Spanish Civil War begins, with Franco’s army allied with Mussolini and Hitler against the Spanish Republic</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/rock-hewn-churches-of-lalibela"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rock-hewn%20churches%20of%20Lalibela.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rock-hewn churches of Lalibela</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Haile Selassie makes a pilgrimage to the churches during the Second Italo-Ethiopian War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/haile-selassie"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Haile%20Selassie.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Haile Selassie</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Defeated at the Battle of Maychew, he leaves Ethiopia on 2 May and addresses the League of Nations on the Italian invasion</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/beowulf"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Beowulf.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Beowulf</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">J. R. R. Tolkien's lecture Beowulf: The Monsters and the Critics opens modern criticism</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/armenian-ssr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Armenian%20SSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Armenian SSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">First Secretary Aghasi Khanjian is killed by Lavrentiy Beria in Tiflis on 9 July, beginning the Great Purge in Armenia; the TSFSR is dissolved and Armenia becomes a union republic</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/francoist-spain"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Francoist%20Spain.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Francoist Spain</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Junta de Defensa Nacional, governing the Nationalist-held territories, recognises Franco as Caudillo of Spain on 1 October</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/second-spanish-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Second%20Spanish%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Second Spanish Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Popular Front wins the general election of 16 February</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/second-spanish-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Second%20Spanish%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Second Spanish Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">An army uprising in Spanish Morocco on 17 July begins the Spanish Civil War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battles-of-khalkhin-gol"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battles%20of%20Khalkhin%20Gol.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battles of Khalkhin Gol</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Soviet Union and Mongolia sign a Mutual Assistance Pact, allowing Soviet troops into Mongolia</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/madrid"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Madrid.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Madrid</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The military rising is defeated in Madrid and the city is besieged until 1939</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/addis-ababa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Addis%20Ababa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Addis Ababa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Italian troops enter the city and make it the capital of Italian East Africa</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/gondar"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Gondar.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Gondar</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Italian troops occupy Gondar without a fight</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/harar"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Harar.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Harar</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Italian forces capture Harar, which becomes the capital of the Harar Governorate</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/santo-domingo"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Santo%20Domingo.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Santo Domingo</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The city is renamed Ciudad Trujillo after the dictator Rafael Trujillo</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/b-r-ambedkar"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/B.%20R.%20Ambedkar.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>B. R. Ambedkar</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Publishes Annihilation of Caste and founds the Independent Labour Party</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/surrealism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Surrealism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Surrealism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The London International Surrealist Exhibition is organised by Herbert Read, with an introduction by Breton</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/mau-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mau%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mau movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A Samoan Fono with elected representatives is opened at Mulinu'u after the election of a Labour Government in New Zealand</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/marxism-leninism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Marxism%E2%80%93Leninism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Marxism–Leninism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Great Purge begins, lasting until 1938; the Soviet Constitution of the same year is adopted</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/stalinism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Stalinism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Stalinism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Great Terror begins in September, with Nikolai Yezhov heading the NKVD, and the Moscow Trials run to 1938</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/libertarianism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Libertarianism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Libertarianism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Spanish Revolution brings libertarian socialism its greatest popularity</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/syndicalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Syndicalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Syndicalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Spanish Revolution puts much of Spain's economy under workers' control, with the CNT as the main union organisation of the Republican side</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/korean-shamanism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Korean%20shamanism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Korean shamanism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Japanese colonial government launches the Mind Cultivation Movement, among its measures to suppress Musok</span></li></ul></section>
